<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_783_2083.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser freuntlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyennd</unclear> euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersamen</unclear>,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear>, lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünndt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kurtzverruckhter</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>tagen, ist ains weibs person, so sich <persName resp="#ner">Magdalena Gmainde-
<lb n="4"/>rin</persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName> nempt, uff dem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-92" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rein</placeName> herab in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>stat komen. Unnd sich alda zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maister</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Georgen</persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> scherer
<lb n="6"/>gethon, in willen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Mainung, sich an irem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grosßen</unclear> ge-
<lb n="7"/>brechen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> schaden, so sy an ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schenckhel</unclear> hat, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haylen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">artzneien</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zulaßen</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> mit dem-
<lb n="9"/>selben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maister</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Georgen</persName> dem scherer, sovil geredt
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> gehandlet, das er sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuehailen</unclear>, unnd iren mit der
<lb n="11"/>hilff Gottes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuhelffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuegesagt</unclear>. Doch mit disem geding,
<lb n="12"/>das sy ime umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">atzung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">artztlon</unclear>, das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entrichtet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> bezalt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">möge</unclear>, bürgschafft geben
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dieweil</unclear> aber sy <persName resp="#ner">Magdalena</persName> gar <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelt</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unerkant</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frembd</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bürg</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/>schafft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerlangen</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewüßt</unclear>, ist sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> heüt
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dato</unclear>, vor unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> all ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anligen</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßgleichen</unclear> das sy bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> noch uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwayhundert</unclear> guldin
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> uff ainer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Matten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vallen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hette</unclear>, für-
<lb n="20"/>bringen. Unnd dabey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demütig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anrueffen</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irem</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölichem</unclear> irem Nöten, umb Gottes willen,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behilfflich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> beraten zusein, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölchs</unclear> durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> schreiben
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guets</unclear>, bey euch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerkhundigen</unclear>. Unnd bey
<lb n="24"/>iren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünnden</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwannten</unclear>, daruff bürgschafft
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerforderen</unclear>. Dieweil dann wir iren, unnd
<lb n="26"/>allen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bresthafftigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leüten</unclear>, wo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglichen</unclear>, gern beholffen,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürdersam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zusein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgenaigt</unclear>. Sy <persName resp="#ner">Magdalena</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geprechens</unclear> (als uns nit zweifelt) durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genannten</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maister</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Georgen</persName>, als ainen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frummen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschickhten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maister</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehailet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> iren geholffen werden mag. So ist an
